= Deploy the Java Encoder Project =

The OWASP Java Encoder version 1.2 is now available in central!

[https://search.maven.org/#search%7Cga%7C1%7Cg%3A%22org.owasp.encoder%22 OWASP Encoder at Maven Central].

== Core ==
Direct Download: [http://search.maven.org/remotecontent?filepath=org/owasp/encoder/encoder/1.2/encoder-1.2.jar encoder-1.2.jar]

== Maven for Core Encoder == 
 <dependency>
    <groupId>org.owasp.encoder</groupId>
    <artifactId>encoder</artifactId>
    <version>1.2</version>
 </dependency>

== JSP Tag Library ==
Direct Download: [https://search.maven.org/remotecontent?filepath=org/owasp/encoder/encoder-jsp/1.2/encoder-jsp-1.2.jar encoder-jsp-1.2.jar]

=== Maven for JSP Tag Library ===
 <dependency>
    <groupId>org.owasp.encoder</groupId>
